  "whatsapp_greeting": "\ud83d\udc4b Hi! I'm Aria, your virtual Chief Operating Officer for The Exit Blueprint.\n\nI'm here to guide you through building, scaling, and exiting your business. I have expertise in:\n\n\ud83d\udcca Business Strategy & Analytics\n\ud83d\udcbc Sales & CRM Optimization  \n\u2696\ufe0f Corporate Law & Compliance\n\ud83d\udcbb Technical Implementation\n\ud83c\udfa8 Branding & Marketing\n\nI can help you with:\n\u2022 Stage-specific guidance (Ideation \u2192 Exit)\n\u2022 Financial modeling & valuation\n\u2022 CRM analytics & sales forecasting\n\u2022 Lead quality scoring & segmentation\n\u2022 Sales goal tracking & optimization\n\u2022 Pitch deck & document drafting\n\u2022 Due diligence preparation\n\u2022 Custom business reports\n\nWhat would you like to work on today?",
